-14.25  TD -0.0436  Tc 0.2481  Tw (of a thief armed with hacking tools publicly available on the Internet.) Tj0 -27.75  TD -0.0487  Tc 0.2987  Tw (A core problem of the information security industry is that, as an industry, we do not) Tj0 -13.5  TD -0.21  Tc 0.71  Tw (even have a ) Tj60 0  TD -0.0653  Tc 0.3153  Tw (unit which measures product effectiveness.  We are selling ) Tj284.25 0  TD 0.1191  Tc -0.1191  Tw (something which) Tj-344.25 -13.5  TD -0.0888  Tc 0.3388  Tw (is intangible and ) Tj82.5 0  TD -0.0474  Tc 0.2349  Tw (unquantifiable; we are basically selling fashion rather than function.) Tj-82.5 -25.5  TD -0.0719  Tc 0.3933  Tw (To put this problem in economic terms, we operate in a market with severely restricted) Tj0 -13.5  TD -0.0645  Tc 0.4395  Tw (transparency. Customers do not have good information about product quality.  They have) Tj0 -14.25  TD -0.076  Tc 0.3885  Tw (no basis on which to compare products.  Because information about losses and) Tj0 -13.5  TD -0.0569  Tc 0.403  Tw (vulnerabilities is very poor, they do not even have good information about their own) Tj0 -14.25  TD -0.0309  Tc 0  Tw (requirements.) Tj0 -29.25  TD /F0 14.25  Tf-0.1113  Tc 0.2988  Tw (4. Prescription) Tj0 -27.75  TD /F0 12  Tf-0.0552  Tc 0.1915  Tw (The solution to both problems \(technical and business\) is the same: ) Tj325.5 0  TD 0.0313  Tc 0.7187  Tw (monetize information) Tj-325.5 -14.25  TD -0.138  Tc 0  Tw (security.) Tj0 -27.75  TD -0.1613  Tc 0.6113  Tw (What would it mean to ) Tj113.25 0  TD -0.0795  Tc 0.4545  Tw (monetize information security?) Tj-113.25 -27  TD /F1 12  Tf-0.27  Tc 0  Tw (\267) Tj6 0  TD /F2 12  Tf0  Tc -0.336  Tw ( ) Tj12 0  TD /F0 12  Tf-0.0796  Tc 0.5081  Tw (Quantify and publish loss information in dollar terms) Tj-18 -15  TD /F1 12  Tf-0.27  Tc 0  Tw (\267) Tj6 0  TD /F2 12  Tf0  Tc -0.336  Tw ( ) Tj12 0  TD /F0 12  Tf-0.0238  Tc 0.3571  Tw (Quantify and publish product effectiveness information \(dif